    "body": "@oblitum To my knowledge, Starship does not yet support VI mode. But, this shouldn't be that hard to add!\r\n\r\n[Spaceship implementation](https://github.com/denysdovhan/spaceship-prompt/blob/master/sections/vi_mode.zsh)\r\n\r\n> I've seen it being implemented in two ways, with dual prompts, like `❯❯❯` or `❯` for insert mode and `❮❮❮` or `❮` for normal mode (could be configurable), or with an additional section, like, `[I] ➜` and `[N] ➜`. sorin and pure prompts do the former, spaceship does the latter.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think @matchai ... which way should we do it?",
