    "body": "No, we don't have a Vi mode indicator yet, but I think it would be a valuable addition to the prompt.\r\n\r\n> I've seen it being implemented in two ways, with dual prompts, like ❯❯❯ or ❯ for insert mode and ❮❮❮ or ❮ for normal mode (could be configurable), or with an additional section, like, [I] ➜ and [N] ➜. sorin and pure prompts do the former, spaceship does the latter.\r\n\r\nI think in the end it would be configurable. Switching between `❮` and `❯` definitely looks better, but that would involve changing our prompt character from `➜` to `❯`. (Admittedly, this is one of the few configuration changes I do myself) 🤔 ",
